window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The wolf shifters are cursed with a broken mating bond. For years, no one has felt the bond that has helped us find our mates for centuries. And now we're left mateless.</b></p> <p>Without the bond, we are slowly dying off. Our packs are growing smaller, weaker. Our powers are slowly diminishing.</p> <p>And it's my pack's fault.</p> <p>We caused the curse.</p> <p>But I'll be the one to break it.</p> <p>There's a prophecy—one that I know is about me. I'm destined to break the curse, to fix what my pack caused.</p> <p>Before I can fulfill the prophecy, I'm attacked by my best friend, who finally gains his wolf, unlike me, who remains wolf-less. The Bloodmoon alpha rescues me. But I quickly realize when he carries me to a gathering of all the packs that this is no rescue. I'm the Bloodmoon's offering.</p> <p>Every month, the wolves gather to try to find their mates through an offering. Females from each pack are offered to the alphas in hopes that a mate is found and the curse is broken. If an alpha feels the tug of the mating bond, then they mark her as their mate.</p> <p>But if you are marked by an alpha who isn't your true mate...you die.</p> <p>Suddenly, the prophecy's murky words don't hold much promise of me breaking the curse when death is on the line, and I have a new goal—survive.</p> <p>Marked by Moonlight <i>is book one in a new dark wolf shifter romance series. This series includes a world of wolf shifters, vampires, witches, and magic.</i></p>"; 
